{"blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "ｸﾞﾙｸﾞﾙ"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ｶﾞﾗｶﾞﾗｶﾞﾗｶﾞﾗ  ..."}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ﾊﾟｶｯ   !!"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ｼﾞｬｼﾞｬｰﾝ"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "∧＿∧           ╭◜◝   ◜◝   ◜◝ ╮\n‎꒰ ˶ ɞ̴̶̷ ༝ ɞ̴̶̷ ˶꒱   .oO   3.141592653...\n‎  /づ~‎〇          ╰◟◞   ◟◞   ◟◞ ╯"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "神奈川県出身 20歳\n日向坂46  五期生のまつおさくらです。\nブログを開いて下さり本当に本当にありがとうございます。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ニンゲンがその時思いついたことをペラペラ喋っているブログだよ"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/moblog/202605/mob37FOiv.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "それでは円周率ブログ\nれっつごぉ\nと行きたいですが\nこのポーズ初期に大野さんがしてました"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "©️大野愛実  ですね"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "お借りしますよ"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/moblog/202605/mobEKW3mX.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "MVでは、10人全員がお揃いのネクタイをつけていてとても嬉しかった"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ネクタイの付け方は分からないので\n不思議そうに見つめてます"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/moblog/202605/mob8QkCcg.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今回はドラムお姉さんでした"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "楽器はほぼできません"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "何も習ってないからです\n小学生の頃に、1度だけ\n聖者の行進をピアノで弾いたことがあります、"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "音楽朝会ではアコーディオンが一番好きでした"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "1番前の列で唯一座って演奏できるからです"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ドラムは1度だけ触れたことがあります"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "吹奏楽部の入部体験を訪れたことがあるからです"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/moblog/202605/mobvTM2Z6.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ドラムお姉さんは、\nこういう写真を撮るのが好きです\n#sakuloveletterではシブツタＶｅｒ．を送りましたが"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "この列を円周率くらい伸ばしたいです"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "なんかゆうちゃんを撮ってる人を撮ってる人いた"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/moblog/202605/mob9vv44c.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "円周率は、3でいいじゃんって\n学生時代思った事がありますか??"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "私もです\n特に数学が苦手だったので"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "けど省略など簡単なことを避けてめんどくさいことをすることによって、ロマンなどが詰まっている数字に生まれ変わる所が円周率の唯一の好きなところです"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "五期生の関係も円周率のように\n来世まで続けばいいのに～～"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ハートのダーツとπのポーズ"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/moblog/202605/mobcRboCr.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ダーツもやったことないので\n私の中では\nダーツ🟰「死亡遊戯(ダーツDEダーツ)｣"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ハンター試験会場に向かっていると\nアンドロイドに出会いました"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "快く人間との写真を撮ってくれたよ"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/moblog/202605/mobwWoy4s.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "！\nなんか困ってる？"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "トモコレのゲーム実況観すぎて、「エ！」って聞くとトモコレ思い出しちゃう"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ちなみに\n「円周率」で結成されたバンドでは\n喧嘩中の映像が流れています"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "1:42（ぁぁぁぁぁ）ってなってるのは、\n喧嘩うるさーい！の顔"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ここでバンドメンバーの写真と思いきや\nしれっとひなnon"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/moblog/202605/mobKBkwYv.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "7月15日、16日に\nぴあアリーナMMにて開催される\n五期生ライブ の申し込みも\nスタートしておりますので"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ぜひチェックして下さい！！！！！\n🔗https://www.hinatazaka46.com/s/official/page/5th_generation_live?ima=0000"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "観にきてくださった皆さまに円周率くらいこのライブが続けばいいのに～"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "と言ってもらえるようなライブにします！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ぜひもう1回\n円周率聴いてね\n🔗https://youtu.be/5lBX4kt4eUI"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "午後も頑張ろうね"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "お仕事、生活、学校、色々あった方は、お疲れ様！また明日も一緒に頑張ろうねー！\nこれからお仕事や予定がある方も一緒に頑張ろー！🌟"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "私が頑張れー！！！\nってずーっと応援しているよ\nあなたの頑張りは桜が見ているからね。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "明日も素敵な一日になりますように。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "読んでくれて本当にありがとう！！！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "またね"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "明日も元気にさくラブリー ( ̳- ·̫ - ̳ˆ )◞❤︎"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "#sakulovelog"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "82さく"}], "source": "official"}